# state: any   (the golden cc9b4ced4a0f holds pathfind's profile; lane.accuracy804, #804)
# RalliSport Challenge (4D53000F): to the Safari SS-1 race start, then hands off the pad, so a
# rival passes the stationary player at about race clock 8 s, the stretch where flicker801
# recorded the rival's body on alternate frames.
#
# Fixed waits only. A dispatched soak gets the route's TEXT (dispatcher.sh writes route.txt in
# the result dir), so a `waitfor` reference crop does not travel with it.
#
#   0-65 s: no input. The survey soak 1-1791124360-lanelocal-3022739 (Nova, 10-04 07:33) had
#           the in-engine intro still running at +65 s, and START there gave the title by +71 s.
#   title A -> profile select A (pathfind's replay on this golden: A here reaches the main menu)
#   -> main menu A (Career is lit) -> SELECT EVENT A (Safari) -> SELECT CAR A -> loading ->
#   SAFARI SS-1 OPTIONS, "start race" lit -> A at ~+127 s.
#   Every menu input is A, so one lost press delays the race by one step instead of
#   diverging. The second A at ~+136 s starts the race if one press was lost; in a running
#   race A does nothing visible (survey frames 07:35:47-07:37:26).
#   Race clock starts 7-12 s after the start-race A (pathfind replay 7 s, survey career 12 s);
#   the rival pass is at race clock ~8 s, so about +142..+149 s.
wait 20
shot boot20
wait 20
shot boot40
wait 20
mark booted
press START
wait 5
shot title
wait 3
press A
wait 6
press A
wait 6
press A
wait 6
shot event
press A
wait 6
shot car
press A
wait 25
shot options
press A
wait 8
press A
wait 5
shot r1
wait 3
shot r2
wait 3
shot r3
wait 3
shot r4
wait 4
shot r5
mark gameplay
repeat forever {
    wait 20
    shot hold
}
